1:#!/bin/bash
2:# Run the regression gates. `./run.sh` runs all of them; `./run.sh 2 4` runs a subset.
3:#
4:# Order matters: the build gate produces the binaries the rest test, and the hygiene gate
5:# reads the logs the MIPS gate produces.
