13:#  the form "the battery is green", and until now NOTHING checked how many gates that
14:#  covered -- so a gate silently dropped from the array above would have looked exactly
15:#  like a battery that was always this size.  The count was also wrong in three places
16:#  at once: this README said "all six", the top-level README stopped at 13, and the
17:#  working notes had said both 15 and 17.  A number nobody checks is not a fact.
18:#
19:#  Adding a gate means editing BOTH lines, deliberately.  That is the point.
20:GATE_MANIFEST=16
